<div class="av-special-heading av-fqtctw-887fe057d5aa66fca7fb1da9fc0a469b av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-16 el_after_av_image el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">AI-Assisted Detoxification — Restoring Biological Balance</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-dn439g-6b2ce9101bfed1d399b1c7ded9a42140" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>A science-based, medically supervised process with minimal discomfort and rapid recovery. We combine advanced detox protocols with AI-guided, medication-free TMS therapy to support the brain, reduce cravings, and help you safely and comfortably begin your transformation.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-m6b6hunf-bf34ac7687046fc77f33f301811a33ee av_one_third avia-builder-el-18 el_after_av_one_third el_before_av_one_third three-box-hover flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="avia-image-container av-mij8govr-191827f881f77f2c6eaa64c28388045c av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-19 el_before_av_heading avia-builder-el-first" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="brain" class="wp-image-2315 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-2315 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="64" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 64px) 100vw, 64px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/brain.png" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/brain.png 64w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/brain-36x36.png 36w" title="brain" width="64"/></div></div></div>
<div class="av-special-heading av-mij6p46m-0b0db95506aaa382f684256de5ed0097 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-20 el_after_av_image el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Brain Repair <span class="special_amp">&amp;</span> Neuroscience — Healing at the Cellular Level</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mij891qb-3287f0e4281a9c336ff35805c96ad320" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>We strengthen and restore brain function using advanced neurotherapies — including <strong>nutraceutical protocols</strong>, <strong>hyperbaric oxygen therapy</strong>, and <strong>AI-guided TMS</strong><strong> to support cognitive performance in astronauts</strong>. Together, these treatments improve cognition, mood, memory, and neurological resilience — helping you feel like yourself again.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-m6b6i0xw-05619cb530576ed526980fb34847e888 av_one_third avia-builder-el-22 el_after_av_one_third avia-builder-el-last three-box-hover flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="avia-image-container av-mij8g3ul-3c586b48a27f1fb76ddb5f156e0d29cd av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-23 el_before_av_heading avia-builder-el-first" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="physiotherapy" class="wp-image-2314 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-2314 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="64" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 64px) 100vw, 64px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/physiotherapy.png" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/physiotherapy.png 64w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/physiotherapy-36x36.png 36w" title="physiotherapy" width="64"/></div></div></div>
<div class="av-special-heading av-m6b6i6ba-877127a43708a1aaa85f4baa036d4269 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-24 el_after_av_image el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Rehabilitation — The Global Gold Standard in Lasting Recovery</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mij88r81-736db2927a9a39251111b1ccca5bddcc" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>This advanced, priority-motivational treatment model was <strong>developed by Dr. Johnson</strong> and has been successfully adopted by <strong>several hundred clinics worldwide</strong> under his training. Patients also receive comprehensive <strong>psychological support from licensed psychologists</strong>, wrapped into a full <strong>wellness program</strong> that strengthens mind-body balance, life skills, and long-term recovery success.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
<p></p>
