<div class="flex_column av-c3qckk-2acff8b40f321f178ac61e8483a42782 av_one_full avia-builder-el-27 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m6b6jeb5-a642d0d4df1e790b14a22feb10c3becc av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-28 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Casa Privée – Advanced Brain Institute</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m4bh06ak-d84e18017a62480cae7b3c0e825b2341" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>At Casa Privée, we believe <strong>health begins with the brain</strong>. As Miami’s premier <strong>luxury Advanced Brain Institute</strong>, we specialize in diagnosing and treating <strong>neurological and neuropsychiatric disorders</strong> in both children (including autism and ADHD) and adults (including Parkinson’s disease, Alzheimer’s, depression, and addiction).</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column_table av-m4bp6kyc-464e33cb78fdf9d4215b896dacbf3955 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-m4bp6kyc-464e33cb78fdf9d4215b896dacbf3955 av_one_half avia-builder-el-30 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="avia-video av-mikljjqy-0f6509f979e0a941bffe872df0b96101 avia-video-16-9 av-no-preview-image avia-video-load-always avia-video-html5" data-original_url="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Untitled_design_8_gg8qzq.mp4" itemprop="video" itemtype="https://schema.org/VideoObject"><span class="mejs-offscreen">Video Player</span><div aria-label="Video Player" class="mejs-container mejs-container-keyboard-inactive avia_video mejs-video" id="mep_1" role="application" style="background: transparent; width: 480px; height: 270px; min-width: 0px;" tabindex="0"><div class="mejs-inner"><div class="mejs-mediaelement"><mediaelementwrapper id="player_2308_1865317497_2145947748"><video autoplay="" class="avia_video av-mediajs-loaded" id="player_2308_1865317497_2145947748_html5" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="metadata" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Untitled_design_8_gg8qzq.mp4"><source src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Untitled_design_8_gg8qzq.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video></mediaelementwrapper></div><div class="mejs-layers"><div class="mejs-poster mejs-layer" style="display: none; width: 480px; height: 270px;"></div><div class="mejs-overlay mejs-layer" style="width: 480px; height: 270px; display: none;"><div class="mejs-overlay-loading"><span class="mejs-overlay-loading-bg-img"></span></div></div><div class="mejs-overlay mejs-layer" style="display: none; width: 480px; height: 270px;"><div class="mejs-overlay-error"></div></div><div class="mejs-overlay mejs-layer mejs-overlay-play" style="width: 480px; height: 270px; display: none;"><div aria-label="Play" aria-pressed="false" class="mejs-overlay-button" role="button" tabindex="0"></div></div></div><div class="mejs-controls" style="display: none;"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-d6vgi-9b12efd5e70d8a32bea8a4a5bffc32a3 av_one_half avia-builder-el-32 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last mobile-text flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-mij8kvc3-56c94048493c9445ee384691f94b303c" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Our approach combines <strong>cutting-edge medical science</strong> with personalized, compassionate care. We utilize advanced technologies — from AI-guided neurotherapies and brainwave-based rehabilitation and wellness protocols — all meticulously designed to <strong>reduce neuroinflammation, restore brain function, and improve quality of life</strong>.</p>
<p>Rather than masking symptoms, our focus is on <strong>repairing the brain at the cellular level</strong>, giving each patient the opportunity to reclaim clarity, emotional balance, and independence. Every treatment plan is tailored to the individual, ensuring a smooth and private healing experience.</p>
<p>Whether seeking recovery from addiction, support for cognitive disorders, or optimization of brain performance, Casa Privée provides a world-class environment where <strong>healing becomes transformation</strong>.</p>
<p>Your journey to better thinking, better feeling, and a better life begins here.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-2azbqw3-f16d953de1767eff19bd45af394c6690 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-34 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_5"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-2308"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
