3025!important">e</span></span></div><div class="wp-google-wr"><a href="https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw" onclick="return rplg_leave_review_window.call(this)" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">review us on<svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="rpi-slides-root grw-content"><div class="grw-content-inner"><button class="rpi-ltgt rpi-lt grw-prev" tabindex="0"></button><div class="rpi-slides grw-reviews rpi-slides-bite" data-count="10" data-offset="10"><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Mindri Ureña profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_e9e8833c54d4abda90e23a6f0febe975.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101861222635953781367/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Mindri Ureña</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1741099048">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">The staff at Casa Privéé are incredibly attentive and professional, providing top-tier service from start to finish. They make you feel welcome and comfortable, ensuring a seamless experience throughout your visit. The hyperbaric chamber at the facility is truly state-of-the-art, offering a unique and effective therapy session that enhances overall well-being. With both exceptional staff and cutting-edge equipment, Casa Privéé offers an unparalleled experience.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Victoria Vina profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_598939d907ad15e510e6836413559d83.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109126671838368436143/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Victoria Vina</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740679547">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:4"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">Casa privee has been a treatment center for my dad for a while now as we see a difference in his health we are not very fond of the doctor he is not a personable person and shows zero emotion towards a patient who is under going serious treatments. On the other hand their staff is amazing if anything those are the ones that keep us going specifically their nurse she so helpful and kind my dad speaks so highly of her. We would definitely recommend Casa privee based on staff and treatment results, not on doctor.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Ellie Platt profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_1cc4b88e87aba4f5014a879fc0912f8c.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114078815515553781652/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Ellie Platt</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740679503">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">Everyone here is so friendly and professional! From the moment I walked in, the front desk staff made me feel welcome, and the technicians were incredibly helpful and reassuring. It’s rare to find a place that’s both inviting and efficient—I’m so glad I chose to come here!</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Melie Viera profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_9d61c3e1fbb5519502e38ee92ad4675b.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117516673139424208263/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Melie Viera</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740678223">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">State of the art facility with a staff that takes care of your every need. I had been looking for a hyperbaric chamber for years in Miami. This is the real deal not compressed air, real oxygen.  I will be a guest there for the rest of my life.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Nakita Gutierrez profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_93276e9d2cd7c103358b128c68447343.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112297378318894430133/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Nakita Gutierrez</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740677656">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">My experience with Casa Privee was nothing short of amazing, from easy booking options to being welcomed with warm compassionate staff members 10/10 recommended</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Natalie Lopez profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_b4cbc81cdef1cfd8020360e720ecdb96.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104660695699430578163/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Natalie Lopez</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740531764">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">Casa Privée provides top-notch TMS therapy in a welcoming and professional environment. The staff is knowledgeable, caring, and dedicated to patient well-being. The treatment was comfortable, non-invasive, and truly effective. I noticed significant improvements in my mood and focus. Highly recommend for anyone considering TMS therapy!</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Elio Capestany profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_330a2b0b964d70fab4bce39ee1e33c3a.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112844269293868544387/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Elio Capestany</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740531378">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">I felt immediate relief from fatigue after the IV fluids treatment at Casa Priveé. Top-notch service, Thank you Jhonny!</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="George Rodriguez profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_eb65b0ce40264e0c985eb99ff16644cc.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115883176141384774752/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">George Rodriguez</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740531291">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">The IV fluids treatment was just what I needed after my long trip. I felt re-energized instantly, the best part is that the team at Casa Privee listens to you first to properly advise which IV fluids treatment is best for you.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Kristina Gracheva profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_d699e40b7bf65eecb782acf2f662df37.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110909015010198933439/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Kristina Gracheva</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740529459">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">excellent service, many innovative devices that many clinics do not have, highly qualified staff and reasonable prices</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Bahae Fayyad profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='../wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_21a19a00792cb740a4c4f2dd9456fd82.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113110349294216585882/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Bahae Fayyad</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740253830">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">I love the personalized hormone replacement therapy I received; it made a big difference in my energy levels, thanks to Casa Priveé and its team, now I feel like a different person.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div></div><button class="rpi-ltgt rpi-gt grw-next" tabindex="0"></button><div class="rpi-dots-wr